// Forwards the workspace's shared compiler options to the golden fixture.
//
// `__fixtures__/demo-thing/` is a byte-for-byte copy of what the generator
// emits, and what it emits is a package that lives at `packages/<id>/` — so
// its `tsconfig.json` says `"extends": "../../tsconfig.base.json"`. The
// fixture sits two levels below *this* directory instead, so that relative
// path lands here. Editing the fixture's own extends path to suit its
// checked-in location would make the golden file stop being a copy of the
// emitted bytes, which is the one property it exists to have.
//
// Vite's TS transform (and therefore the `create-module` vitest project,
// which runs the fixture's `module.test.ts` as a real test) resolves this at
// load time; `tsc` reaches the fixture through this package's own
// `tsconfig.json` and never reads this file.
{
  "extends": "../../tsconfig.base.json"
}
